factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script says the AIADMK protest is held in Thuraiyur ('துறையூரில் ... அதிமுக ஆர்ப்பாட்டம் நடத்துகிறது'), but the article only says it will be held by the Tiruchi Rural North district AIADMK; no protest location in Thuraiyur is stated.
  The reel_script says the video was 'வெளியாகி' and that Karthik Kumar 'குற்றம் சாட்டியுள்ளார்' regarding being insulted and assaulted, which is accurate, but the caption's claim that 'சம்பந்தப்பட்டவர் தரப்பிலிருந்து புகார் எதுவும் அளிக்கப்படவில்லை' is attributed to a statement that 'it is said' in the article, so the caption presents it as established fact rather than as reported.
  The slides_spec line 'சமூக செயல்பாட்டாளர் தாக்கப்பட்ட நிலையில் அரசு உரிய நடவடிக்கை எடுக்கவில்லை' is ungrammatical and mixes two facts: the article says the AIADMK accuses the government (TVK government) of watching without action after a social activist was attacked; the Tamil phrasing 'அரசு உரிய நடவடிக்கை எடுக்கவில்லை' is stated as fact in the reel_script rather than as AIADMK's accusation.
